---

This license covers the AR Game portal code (the Next.js application in `src/`,
`scripts/`, and `tests/`) and the original games built for this project:
Snake Arena, Mind Tiles, and Reflex Rush.

Games vendored from third-party open source projects under `public/games/`
keep their own licenses. Each game folder contains the upstream LICENSE file,
and every catalog entry in `src/data/games.ts` records its `source` and
`license`. Notably, several vendored games are GPL-3.0 (Hextris, Pac Chase,
Mahjong Solitaire, Billiards, Endless Runner); they are served as standalone
static files inside an iframe and are not linked into this application's code.
